"The system-wide limit on the total number of open files has been reached."
msgstr ""
"La limite du nombre total de fichiers ouverts pour le système entier a été "
"atteinte."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The user hard limit on memory that can be allocated for pipes has been "
"reached and the caller is not privileged; see B<pipe>(7)."
msgstr ""
"La limite dure de l'utilisateur en mémoire qu'il est possible d'allouer aux "
"tubes a été atteinte et l'appelant n'est pas privilégié ; voir B<pipe>(7)."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<ENOPKG>"
msgstr "B<ENOPKG>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"(B<pipe2>())  B<O_NOTIFICATION_PIPE> was passed in I<flags> and support for "
"notifications (B<CONFIG_WATCH_QUEUE>)  is not compiled into the kernel."
msgstr ""
"(B<pipe2>())  B<O_NOTIFICATION_PIPE> a été passé dans I<flags> et la prise "
"en charge pour les notifications (B<CONFIG_WATCH_QUEUE>) n'est pas compilée "
"dans le noyau."

#. type: SH
